    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "ok i think i get that. so if i put my hand on my throat while saying sssss it feels still, but when i say zzzzz i can feel it shaking. is there a specific way to describe that \"shaking\" or \"buzzing\" feeling in technical terms? like is there a name for that specific kind of sound energy?",
